TITLE: MIL-STD-498 SSS (System/Subsystem Specification)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SSS-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: System Overview
STATEMENT: The system shall provide comprehensive satellite communication management capabilities.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SSS-002
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: System Architecture
STATEMENT: The system shall implement distributed microservices architecture with containerized deployment.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SSS-003
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: System Integration
STATEMENT: The system shall integrate with existing satellite networks and ground control systems.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
